#% title
# graphics_complex

#% text
# `graphics_complex(points, content)` gives primitives whose coordinates are indices into `points` (from 1); it evaluates to the ordinary primitives.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
graphics(graphics_complex([[0, 0], [1, 0], [1, 1], [0, 1]], [light_blue, polygon([1, 2, 3, 4]), red, point([1, 2, 3, 4])]))
#% output
